# Ekta & Ajay — Wedding Invitation Website (v2)

A multi-page, fully animated, mobile-first wedding invitation site rebuilt with a modern tech stack.

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| **Framework** | Astro | Multi-page static site, zero JS by default, fast load |
| **UI Components** | React (via Astro islands) | Interactive components (RSVP, countdown, posts grid) |
| **Styling** | Tailwind CSS + SCSS | Utility classes for layout, SCSS for custom animations & design tokens |
| **Animations** | GSAP (GreenSock) | Hero reveals, scroll-triggered section entrances, countdown flip |
| **Scroll Animations** | GSAP ScrollTrigger | Pin sections, parallax, fade-in on scroll |
| **Lottie** | lottie-react | Decorative floral, diya, and mandala SVG animations |
| **Fonts** | Google Fonts | Cinzel (headings), Mrs Saint Delafield (script), Karla (body) |
| **Icons** | Lucide React | Clean line icons for venue, time, dress code |
| **Deployment** | Vercel | Auto-deploy on push, free custom domain support |

