## Page Sections & Animations

### 1. Hero
- Full-viewport section with a couple photo or illustrated arch as backdrop
- GSAP timeline on load: names fade + rise, parents' names slide in, hashtag typewriter effect
- Lottie floral garland animates along the arch edges
- Floating petals particle effect (GSAP + CSS)

### 2. Countdown
- Live flip-clock countdown to 20 Nov 2026, 8:00 PM IST (muhurtham)
- Each digit flips with a 3D CSS card-flip animation driven by GSAP
- Subtle gold shimmer on the numbers

### 3. The Festivities (4 Events)
- Horizontal scroll on desktop, vertical stack on mobile
- Each card pins on scroll (GSAP ScrollTrigger pinning)
- Cards animate in with a staggered fade-up
- Events in order:
  - Ring Ceremony — Wed 18 Nov 2026, 4:00 PM
  - Haldi Carnival — Thu 19 Nov 2026 (time TBD)
  - Sangeet — Thu 19 Nov 2026 (time TBD)
  - The Wedding — Fri 20 Nov 2026, 8:00 PM
- Each card: date, time, venue, address, dress code, quote, Directions button, Add to Calendar button

### 4. RSVP
- Multi-step form (React island): Name → Attending → Which events → Guest count → Submit
- Progress bar between steps
- On submit: builds a pre-filled WhatsApp message and opens `wa.me/919116736541`
- Confetti burst on submission (GSAP)

### 5. Updates from Us
- Masonry photo/video grid (CSS Grid + React)
- Images fade in on scroll via GSAP ScrollTrigger
- Videos autoplay muted on hover
- Feed populated from `src/data/posts.ts`

